## 🚀 Installation

Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourname/coupon-app.git

cd coupon-app
```

Install Package

```bash
npm install
```

Start Development Server

```bash
npm run dev
```

Build Production

```bash
npm run build
```

